  "notes": [
    "The prediction target is reported programme sessions divided by 12 calendar months. It includes the effect of any closures and partial-year operation. The only value for Civil Hospital Manali has FY2024–25 sessions equal to its since-start sessions, consistent with start-up in that fiscal year.",
    "Machine counts are March snapshots at the end of each reporting year. They may differ from machines available during earlier months. March session counts are supplied only for checking the transcription and are excluded from the predictors.",
    "Local IDs identify PMNDP reporting sites. The separate links carry exact FDR IDs for the five matched branches. The report represents one public-private programme in one state.",
    "District population is a 2011 geographic context field for exploratory comparisons. Multiple centres serve each district and patient catchments may cross its boundaries.",
    "Lahaul and Spiti is represented by the Kullu centre in the March 2024 report and contributes no separate facility row. No patient, lifetime, or state total is a training label."
